
@startuml
title PayLink - Payment Life Cycle State Diagram

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand sufficient funds
Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud checks fail\nor insufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Payment request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms payment
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses payment
SentToBiller --> Unknown : Timeout (10 seconds)

Unknown --> Completed : Biller later confirms\n(callback / retry / settlement)
Unknown --> Failed : Biller refuses later\nor reconciliation finds no payment

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of FundsHeld
  Funds are held before
  calling the biller.
end note

note right of Unknown
  Money remains held.
  Never refund automatically.

  Retry after:
  1 minute, 5 minutes,
  and 15 minutes.

  After 3 retries,
  wait for reconciliation.
end note

note right of Refunded
  Money is returned
  to the customer's wallet.
end note

@enduml
